cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Chemistry Mastery in teaching, study or research, please cite it as below."
title: "Chemistry Mastery: an open, Mermaid-illustrated chemistry curriculum"
abstract: >-
  A structured, open-source chemistry curriculum spanning absolute beginner
  foundations through undergraduate, postgraduate and research-level material.
  Content is written in Markdown with LaTeX mathematics, balanced chemical
  equations and extensive Mermaid diagrams, and is accompanied by worked
  examples, exercises and fully worked solutions.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Chemistry Mastery contributors"
    name: "Chemistry Mastery contributors"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-11-05"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/metodiev/Chemistry"
keywords:
  - chemistry
  - education
  - open educational resources
  - curriculum
  - mermaid
  - markdown
  - physical chemistry
  - organic chemistry
  - inorganic chemistry
  - analytical chemistry
  - biochemistry
